###
@accessToken = {{loginAutenticado.response.body.$.token}}

### GetAllAnimal
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllAnimal HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### GetAnimalByID
GET http://localhost:40000/getAnimalByID/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

